 "text": "Hey, how are you doing? I usually use a basket on the front or a backpack on the back. Which do you find easier? They' very handy, especially if you got long arms. You can usually reach the shop without getting off. Then a basket is worth trying. Pick one that suits your bike, and go for short test ride first. Not necessarily, it just takes longer. You either have to get off and wheel it along side, or push it behind you.",
